        "title": "Highest quality rescue harness on the market",
        "text": "Quality of materials and stitching is top notch. As you can see from the video, the harness does not put pressure on the dog’s neck/airway. My daughter can safely carry her 84# dog out, if necessary. This harness is also used for helicopter rescues, so you can trust that it will do the job. Don’t cheap out and buy a cheaper one.(We purchased an XL for this dog)",
