        "title": "Great product, but customer service is lacking.",
        "text": "This is a must for my Search & Rescue Border Collie who takes way to many risky routes while doing air scent tasks. That being said, the original purchase came with a broken clasp on one of the connecting shoulder straps (the spring is not in the right place). I initially reached out to them and they provided a replacement, but it was a 4 pt.harness strap rather than a shoulder strap. I reached out again asking to replace the shoulder strap (and mail back the 4 pt. Harness straps), but it was crickets for a response. I cannot find a shoulder strap to purchase that matches what came with them elsewhere either. Again, GREAT product, but really would like a new strap and I get no responses.",
